WEBVTT

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:09.150
Angelique, stay back.

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:12.920
Watch for the right time to purify it.

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:31.090
Light of Purification...

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:45.010
Wow!

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:46.490
Way to go, Orb Hunters!

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:47.220
The Queen's Egg!

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:47.770
Wow!

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:48.320
How divine...

00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:49.960
Go, Orb Hunters!

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:51.290
Orb Hunters?

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:53.340
Yeah, it's because Bernal's article called us that.

00:00:53.390 --> 00:00:56.520
I don't think we called oursevles that, but...

00:00:56.830 --> 00:00:59.300
But why not?

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:02.170
Yeah, everybody's happy.

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:07.530
I'm just glad everyone's safe.

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:43.060
Phase 05: The Journey of Determination

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:17.000
Hey, what does it say?

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:19.830
It says we must go to Celestizam.

00:03:19.890 --> 00:03:21.480
It's a summons from the Head of the Order.

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:22.890
The Head of the Order?

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:23.810
Really?

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:26.840
An invitation from the Holy Capital, huh?

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:30.540
A meeting with the Head of the Order...

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:32.470
Why me?

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:37.770
Whatever the reason, if you've been invited, you have to accept.

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:42.240
The Head of the Order has high expectations of the Queen's Egg.

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:45.600
It's quite an honor to meet him.

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:51.640
It's good to see you, Sir Hyuuga.

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:55.300
It's good to see you in the service of the Queen's Egg.

00:03:55.300 --> 00:04:00.420
Even though you've left the Knights of the Silver Tree, their honor still resides within your breast.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:18.830
The wind feels so good!

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:21.920
I've always wanted to ride up front in a carriage.

00:04:22.050 --> 00:04:26.320
I'm sorry that a guy like me is here to ruin your mood.

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:28.560
Don't be silly...

00:04:29.170 --> 00:04:32.000
It's your first time visiting Celestizam, right?

00:04:32.090 --> 00:04:35.170
Yes, I'm afraid I don't know much about the Order...

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:41.650
The Celestia Order: to those who worship the legendary "Prophesied Queen,"

00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:44.820
they're a mental pillar of support.

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:48.650
And at its head, is the Head of the Order.

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:52.300
Why would I be called to meet somebody so important?

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:56.340
Probably because the Order saw the article they printed yesterday.

00:04:57.720 --> 00:04:59.380
That article...

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:03.490
They want to meet the girl who's rumored to be the Queen's Egg.

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:07.730
It makes sense for the Order to want that much, considering how religiously prominent they are.

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.050
Don't worry.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:14.040
They'll be sure to help us.

00:05:14.090 --> 00:05:15.710
That's right.

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:23.890
Hyuuga...

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:26.350
Why did you leave the Silver Knights?

00:05:26.740 --> 00:05:29.000
Because of my inexperience.

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:31.790
It's not something you should worry about.

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:33.100
Yes...

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:39.470
Can you please drop by Melrose Academy?

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:42.070
I'd like to say hello to the Headmistress.

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:48.610
I can see Hannah and Sally again!

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:51.790
It's been a while!

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:56.060
Angie! Oh Angie, I've missed you!

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:57.540
I saw the paper!

00:05:57.610 --> 00:05:58.960
You were great!

00:05:59.010 --> 00:06:00.090
I wasn't...

00:06:00.450 --> 00:06:01.770
But I'm sorry,

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:04.920
I wanted to come see you sooner.

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:08.880
No, you've got more important things to do than worrying about us.

00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:12.870
Sally's acting all tough.

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:16.720
She was talking about leaving the dorm and going to find you.

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:21.550
Jeez! Even I know that I can't be just go pestering her.

00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:27.230
It really is Angelique!

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:30.920
Hey, wait!

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:35.630
Who would have thought that you'd be the Queen's Egg?

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:38.130
I always knew you were special.

00:06:38.230 --> 00:06:42.760
When you become the Prophesied Queen, don't forget about us, you got that?

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:44.600
What should I do?

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:46.550
This is getting out of hand...

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:50.030
So, you like cooking?

00:06:50.070 --> 00:06:50.800
Yes.

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:54.000
It makes me so happy to see people smile when they eat food I've prepared.

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:56.490
I wish you could all try it.

00:06:56.530 --> 00:06:57.840
I'd love to!

00:06:58.130 --> 00:07:01.560
Don't you get scared fighting Thanatos?

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:04.350
Yes, I always shake with fear!

00:07:04.430 --> 00:07:08.170
But you know, Lein here is pretty valiant.

00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:09.600
Who, me?

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:11.600
Wow!

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:18.310
If I'd known this was going to happen, I would have stayed in the carriage, too.

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:24.190
Angie...

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:28.820
We won't be able to see you for a while, so best of luck, you hear?

00:07:28.890 --> 00:07:31.360
Good luck at being the Queen.

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:33.290
We're behind you all the way.

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:45.200
Is it true the Orb Hunters are looking for a place to stay?

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:49.900
Yeah, apparently the Village Chief heard and he's prepared a welcoming party.

00:07:51.020 --> 00:07:52.370
This...

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:56.910
We've prepared this for our future Queen.

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:58.340
What should we do?

00:07:58.430 --> 00:08:01.740
It'd be rude of us to refuse something so kindly prepared.

00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:04.510
Let's enjoy their benevolence.

00:08:04.510 --> 00:08:09.270
We accept your kindness with thank-

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:16.850
Hey, Mary... we're welcoming an important quest.

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:22.900
Please save my mom, Miss Queen!

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:32.600
Our village has just been attacked by Thanatos, and many have lost their lives.

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:41.870
Fortunately, Mary's mother survived, but since she was attacked, she hasn't regained consciousness.

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:49.150
I'm terribly sorry... I told her not to bother you, but...

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:53.230
But you said Miss Queen could do miracles!

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:57.080
Mom's hands are getting colder.

00:08:57.450 --> 00:08:59.030
If you don't help.

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:03.390
Please, help her!

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:08.320
Mary, I understand your feelings, but don't be selfish.

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:10.700
Um...

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:12.780
If you want, I can...

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:17.520
The future Queen is going to show us a miracle!

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:20.880
Hey, has it started?

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:25.430
I can't really see, but it looks like she's praying.

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:32.330
It's really noisy outside.

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:41.370
Light of Purification, please awaken Mary's mother.

00:09:48.030 --> 00:09:52.570
Back then, I wanted to save people without giving it a second thought.

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:56.480
And it's the same now, but...

00:10:07.210 --> 00:10:09.000
Something's wrong.

00:10:09.050 --> 00:10:10.660
Is she okay?

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:11.540
Is she healed?

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:17.440
...having everyone counting on you is scary...

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:24.300
Miss Queen, please save my mom!

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:27.350
We won't be able to see you for a while, so best of luck, you hear?

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:29.480
Good luck at being the Queen.

00:10:29.530 --> 00:10:31.120
We're behind you all the way.

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:34.930
If I shatter their hopes...

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:41.300
Hey, Angelique, are you all right?

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:44.930
Is she okay?

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:45.800
What's going on?

00:10:45.880 --> 00:10:47.570
Is she not feeling well?

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:51.800
Miss Queen... my mom...

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:59.980
I'm terribly sorry, but she's tired from her long journey.

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:01.510
But my mom...

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:06.370
Let her rest for today, young mademoiselle.

00:11:15.060 --> 00:11:18.310
Then I'll escort you to your rooms for the evening.

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:21.350
This way.

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:31.920
How about it?

00:11:31.990 --> 00:11:36.040
Why don't we spend the night under the stars?

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:52.780
Some tea for you, Angelique.

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:54.860
Thank you.

00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:03.760
If I was stronger...

00:12:04.090 --> 00:12:06.490
The root of this problem is the Thanatos.

00:12:06.750 --> 00:12:09.520
There's no reason for you to feel at fault.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:10.800
But...

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:14.570
Your heart is in pain at the moment, isn't it?

00:12:14.970 --> 00:12:18.070
If only I could take some of it upon myself...

00:12:18.180 --> 00:12:20.930
Hey, I've been thinking this for a while,

00:12:21.110 --> 00:12:25.820
but you have a tendency to put others' needs before your own.

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:28.750
That's not necessarily a bad thing...

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:35.340
It may be down to my mother and father.

00:12:35.780 --> 00:12:38.420
I've always wanted to help people like my parents did.

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:43.490
They were doctors who saved lives...

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:46.210
Dad!

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:48.010
I'll help you too.

00:12:48.210 --> 00:12:49.360
My, my...

00:12:49.590 --> 00:12:51.370
What a cute little doctor.

00:12:51.610 --> 00:12:54.690
She insisted.

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:55.610
See?

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:57.340
She practiced on me.

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:01.290
She'll be quite the doctor someday.

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:08.130
Just after that, our village, Frul, was attacked by Thanatos.

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:20.330
They still have pulses, but...

00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:21.720
Don't give up.

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:24.820
There has to be something we can do!

00:13:36.110 --> 00:13:40.660
My parents worked hard to save others until the very end.

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:44.600
That image of them is the proudest I've ever felt.

00:13:44.680 --> 00:13:47.730
You lived alone after that, didn't you?

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:50.130
You must've been lonely.

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:55.860
No, I had lots of people supporting me, so...

00:13:58.380 --> 00:14:02.670
"Someday I want to become a doctor and save lives."

00:14:02.830 --> 00:14:08.520
I kept wishing for that, and eventually, my purification powers awoke. Before I knew it...

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:13.430
If I use this power, I can save more people.

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:16.560
Yes, that's how I persuaded you.

00:14:16.630 --> 00:14:19.100
And I still believe that to be the case.

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:22.320
But what if I shatter their hopes like today...

00:14:22.850 --> 00:14:26.220
Those hopes and dreams might vanish!

00:14:27.870 --> 00:14:33.410
Your desire to save them is more important than their own opinions.

00:14:34.990 --> 00:14:39.950
They all know you tried your best to save Mary's mother.

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:42.450
Of course, we do too.

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:46.820
I'm sure that you'll be subjected to similar pressures in the future.

00:14:47.140 --> 00:14:49.830
But I shall support you as much as I can.

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:56.650
That's right.

00:14:56.780 --> 00:14:58.590
I'm not alone.

00:14:59.900 --> 00:15:02.710
At last, you've shown us your smile.

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:40.260
You can't sleep?

00:15:41.730 --> 00:15:43.140
Nyx...

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:47.880
I've been considering lots of things...

00:15:50.650 --> 00:15:55.260
Can I really save Arcadia?

00:15:56.640 --> 00:15:58.150
Look around you.

00:15:58.880 --> 00:16:03.260
Blessed by nature, the beautiful flowers bloom everywhere.

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:08.640
How many flowers do you suppose you are looking at right now?

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:10.950
I can't even begin to imagine...

00:16:11.040 --> 00:16:14.030
Even if we spent all day counting their numbers, it still wouldn't be enough.

00:16:14.100 --> 00:16:18.170
Do you know how many flowers there are in the world?

00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:19.260
No...

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:24.520
I'd imagine that the number is so vast, you couldn't even guess at it.

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:30.660
I said once before that you had the power to save many lives.

00:16:30.830 --> 00:16:31.840
Yes.

00:16:32.180 --> 00:16:36.670
However, I did not suggest you could save all of them at the same time.

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:41.960
Just as counting all the flowers in the world is impossible,

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:49.740
you cannot possibly save everyone in the vast land of Arcadia who begs to be saved from their suffering.

00:16:50.080 --> 00:16:52.650
I understand your gentle nature,

00:16:52.830 --> 00:16:58.450
so I know that the pain of not being able to save everyone will overshadow the joy of those you have saved.

00:16:58.510 --> 00:16:59.470
But I...

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:02.230
You'll never survive like that.

00:17:02.300 --> 00:17:04.620
You are the Queen-to-be.

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:06.410
You will rule the people of this land.

00:17:07.030 --> 00:17:12.140
You should instead understand that some sacrifices are necessary.

00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:14.590
Am I wrong?

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:22.610
Nyx is using "adult logic." His experiences may have led him to this answer.

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:25.120
But if I accept that...

00:17:26.410 --> 00:17:28.670
Dad... Mom...

00:17:31.340 --> 00:17:33.010
I think you're wrong.

00:17:34.140 --> 00:17:38.040
It may be foolish pride to think I can save everyone...

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:41.120
but if there's a person suffering in front of me...

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:43.870
I can't just leave them alone.

00:17:48.470 --> 00:17:51.810
I thought you'd say that, Mademoiselle.

00:17:51.890 --> 00:17:55.520
Please, follow the path you believe in.

00:17:56.020 --> 00:18:01.260
And allow me the honor of walking beside you.

00:18:02.110 --> 00:18:06.020
No... I'm sorry if I sound stuck-up.

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:08.740
I'm the one who must ask this of you.

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:11.510
Nyx...

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:14.260
Was he testing me?

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:20.350
No, I was staring at him!

00:18:22.670 --> 00:18:24.480
Oh dear.

00:18:24.550 --> 00:18:26.110
I'm sorry.

00:18:28.890 --> 00:18:34.610
I hope that my warmth may, in turn, warm you.

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:36.180
Thank you.

00:18:49.460 --> 00:18:51.360
Will you pray with me?

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:52.950
Yes!

00:19:06.820 --> 00:19:08.530
Light of Purification...

00:19:28.820 --> 00:19:29.770
Where am I?

00:19:29.820 --> 00:19:30.780
Mom!

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:32.090
Mary...

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:33.150
Mom!

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:39.220
You did it.

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:40.180
Yeah!

00:19:40.370 --> 00:19:41.530
Miss Queen!

00:19:42.400 --> 00:19:45.030
Thank you, Miss Queen!

00:19:45.070 --> 00:19:48.230
No, I'm the one who should be thanking you.

00:19:49.600 --> 00:19:53.070
Thanks to you, I discovered what was really important.

00:19:57.300 --> 00:20:00.350
Yes, you truly are...

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:57.610
I don't really know if I actually have the power to save the world.

00:20:58.430 --> 00:21:01.270
But I'll do everything I can!

00:21:01.550 --> 00:21:04.490
Like my parents used to!

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:20.710
I'm sorry.

00:21:21.450 --> 00:21:24.020
I'd like to remain here.

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:28.510
I abandoned the Knights.

00:21:28.860 --> 00:21:31.500
I cannot taint the Capital with my presence.

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:34.730
I know you'll be fine on your own.

00:21:41.910 --> 00:21:43.100
Angelique...

00:23:36.250 --> 00:23:39.290
I drew a picture of what I think the Head of the Order looks like!

00:23:40.040 --> 00:23:41.940
It has a touch of the avant-garde about it.

00:23:42.340 --> 00:23:43.810
Why are there lights coming from his eyes?

00:23:43.870 --> 00:23:45.500
Those are his laser beams!

00:23:45.620 --> 00:23:47.730
Next time: Visiting the Holy Capital.

00:23:47.810 --> 00:23:49.530
It's his special attack!
